    <string name="settings_speed_test_real">Real-file test</string>
    <string name="settings_speed_test_real_desc">Fully unpacks one NSZ/XCZ you pick, over and over: first with a single thread, then two, up to the core count, then back down again. The output of each run is deleted immediately. Use a 1–2 GB file — the test then takes a couple of minutes, while a larger one drags it out and hammers the storage.</string>
